## New Hive Box Names
```dart
await Hive.openBox<WalletModel>('wallets');
await Hive.openBox<RecurringModel>('recurring');
await Hive.openBox<BudgetModel>('budgets');
```

## New Hive TypeIds
```dart
// TransactionModel → typeId: 0 (existing)
// WalletModel      → typeId: 1
// RecurringModel   → typeId: 2
// BudgetModel      → typeId: 3
```

## Updated router.dart (add Phase 2 routes)
```dart
GoRoute(path: '/search',           builder: (_, __) => const SearchPage()),
GoRoute(path: '/wallets',          builder: (_, __) => const WalletsPage()),
GoRoute(path: '/wallets/add',      builder: (_, __) => const AddWalletPage()),
GoRoute(path: '/wallets/:id',      builder: (_, s)  => WalletDetailPage(id: s.pathParameters['id']!)),
GoRoute(path: '/recurring',        builder: (_, __) => const RecurringPage()),
GoRoute(path: '/recurring/add',    builder: (_, __) => const AddRecurringPage()),
GoRoute(path: '/budget',           builder: (_, __) => const BudgetPage()),
GoRoute(path: '/budget/add',       builder: (_, __) => const AddBudgetPage()),
```

## Phase 2 Implementation Order
1. feature-wallets → wallet entity, model, datasource, repo, usecases, provider, UI
2. feature-search → search page + filter logic (reuses transaction provider)
3. feature-recurring → recurring entity, model, scheduler logic, UI
4. feature-budget → budget entity, model, progress logic, alert banner, UI
5. Update Home page to show wallet selector + budget alert banner
6. Update Add Transaction page to include wallet selector
